
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
  <style>
    @font-face {
  font-family: 'NoirProRegular'; 
  src: url('../../public/font/NoirPro-Regular.woff') format('truetype'); 
}
    @font-face {
  font-family: 'NoirProMed'; 
  src: url('../../public/font/NoirPro-Medium.woff') format('truetype'); 
}

body{
        padding: 8px !important;
       
    }
    h1, h2, .code{
      font-family: NoirProMed, Courier !important;
    }

    p, .address, .button{
      font-family: NoirProRegular, Courier !important;
    }
    .address{
      font-style: italic;
    }
    h1{
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    h2{
      font-size: 22px !important;
    }
    .info{
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 14px;
        margin-top: 12px;
    }
    .info span{
        padding: 12px 0;
        text-align: center;
    }
    .img{
        height: 120px;
        width: 120px;
    }
    .img-container{
        margin-top: 12px;
    }
    .code{
      font-size: 46px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 6px;
    }
    .button{
      background-color: black;
      padding: 12px;
      width: fit-content;
      border-radius: 2px;
      justify-self: center;
    }

  </style>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no">
    <title>Resetare Parola</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://stackpath.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.5.2/css/bootstrap.min.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container-fluid vh-100 cont">
    <div class="text-center img-container col-lg-6 offset-lg-3">
       <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dhetxk68c/image/upload/v1745824224/logo-true/logo-true-group_hxwb9h.svg" alt="logo-image" class="img mb-4">
       <h1 class="mb-4">SALUT <%=data.name%>,</h1>
       <!-- <h1 class="mb-4">SALUT VASILE,</h1> -->
       <h2 class="mb-4">Îți mulțumim că te-ai înregistrat la True Fine Coffee!</h2>
       <p>Acesta este un masaj pentru resetarea parolei, <br> te rugăm sa-ți confirmi adresa de email.  <br> Apasă butunul de mai jos pentru a continua. </p>
       <div class="button">
        <a href="<%=data.link%>" style="color: #fff;">RESETEAZĂ PAROLA</a>
        <!-- <a href="" style="color: #fff;">RESETEAZĂ PAROLA</a> -->
    </div>
    </div>

    <div class="info">
        <span class="address">*Dacă nu ți-ai resetat parola, ignoră acest email.</span>
        <span class="address">*Acest limk este valabil 15 minute.</span>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
